cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use fedcourtsai, please cite it as below. A tag the maintainer
  publishes as a GitHub Release is archived on Zenodo with its own version DOI.
type: software
title: "fedcourtsai: pre-registered AI forecasts of US federal court events"
abstract: >-
  An agentic pipeline that forecasts events in the US federal courts —
  currently Supreme Court dockets: whether the Court takes a case and how it
  rules. Every forecast is committed to a public git ledger before its outcome
  exists, graded against the realized record, and counted only under a
  pre-registered, frozen process.
authors:
  - name: "Model Mirror, LLC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ModelMirrorAI/fedcourtsai"
url: "https://fedcourts.ai"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - Supreme Court
  - forecasting
  - pre-registration
  - large language models
  - legal prediction
